  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temp Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C→F: x*9/5+32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F→C: (x-32)*5/9</p>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input id=\"temperature\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"result-box\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result:</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2e3250;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --border: #5d275d;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--border);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 12px;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.formula {\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  text-align: center;\n  opacity: 0.85;\n}\n\n.field { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\ninput, select, button {\n  width: 100%;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  padding: 10px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transition: transform 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover { background: #ffe08a; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); box-shadow: none; }\n\n.result-box {\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px dashed var(--border);\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.result-label { font-weight: bold; }\n\n#result {\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-size: 20px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 18px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  const input = document.getElementById('temperature');\n  const direction = document.getElementById('direction');\n  const convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\n  const result = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function convert() {\n    const raw = input.value.trim();\n    if (raw === '') {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    const x = Number(raw);\n    if (!Number.isFinite(x)) {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    const dir = direction.value;\n    let out;\n    if (dir === 'c-to-f') {\n      out = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n    } else if (dir === 'f-to-c') {\n      out = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n    } else {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  convertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\n  input.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Temperature Converter\n\nA tiny offline temperature converter with a retro pixel aesthetic. No build step, no dependencies, no network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature in the **Temperature** field (e.g. `100`).\n3. Choose a direction:\n   - `Celsius → Fahrenheit`\n   - `Fahrenheit → Celsius`\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter in the input).\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimals and **no unit** (e.g. `212.00`).\n\nIf the input is empty, non-numeric, or non-finite (e.g. `Infinity`, `NaN`), the result shows exactly `Error`.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9 / 5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5 / 9`\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have visible labels.\n- Keyboard navigation works: Tab to move, Enter to convert.\n- Focus outlines are visible.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Fully offline: plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n- No imports, packages, storage, iframes, or external assets.\n- Layout works from 360px wide.\n- Total implementation under 200 lines.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and structure\n- `styles.css` — pixel-style theme\n- `app.js` — conversion logic\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
